        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Description 与 Product Image 的认知</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimSun\", \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #000;\n    max-width: 700px;\n    margin: 20px auto;\n    padding: 10px 20px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n  h1.section-title {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    margin: 14px 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  p {\n    margin: 4px 0;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    margin-left: 20px;\n  }\n  mark.yellow {\n    background-color: #ffff00;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  table {\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    width: 100%;\n    margin: 14px 0;\n    table-layout: fixed;\n  }\n  th, td {\n    border: 1px solid #000;\n    padding: 8px 10px;\n    text-align: center;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    word-wrap: break-word;\n  }\n  th {\n    background-color: #1f3a93;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    padding: 10px;\n  }\n  .bold {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .tips-block {\n    margin-top: 24px;\n  }\n  .tips-title {\n    font-weight: normal;\n  }\n  a {\n    color: #0563c1;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n  }\n  .link-line {\n    margin: 4px 0;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <h1 class=\"section-title\">四、Description 的认知</h1>\n  <p>1、Description 的作用：更深入说明对五点的补充解释（字符数限制2000以内）</p>\n  <p>2、Description 的内容</p>\n  <p class=\"indent\">1）产品介绍：讲述品牌/产品/用户故事</p>\n  <p class=\"indent\">2）列参数：尺码、型号、规格、配件包装信息等</p>\n  <p class=\"indent\">3）使用方法及感受</p>\n  <p class=\"indent\">4）使用注意事项</p>\n\n  <h1 class=\"section-title\">五、Product Image 的认知</h1>\n  <p>1、Product Image 的作用：给买家带来产品直观印象</p>\n  <p>2、Product Image 的内容</p>\n\n  <table>\n    <colgroup>\n      <col style=\"width:50%\">\n      <col style=\"width:50%\">\n    </colgroup>\n    <tr>\n      <th>主图</th>\n      <th>附图</th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>光线充足，背景<mark class=\"yellow\">纯白色</mark></td>\n      <td>无需纯白底</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>产品最好占据图片大约85%的空间</td>\n      <td>根据展示效果进行排版</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <span class=\"bold\">主图严禁带文字、LOGO、水印、商标等</span><br>\n        <mark class=\"yellow\">（产品本身的logo相关的可以）</mark> 以及不出售的配件\n      </td>\n      <td>可以有logo以及文字描述产品等</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td colspan=\"2\">图片必须是实际商品的照片</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td colspan=\"2\"><mark class=\"yellow\">标准尺寸：1600*1600像素</mark></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td colspan=\"2\">图片上不能含有别人的品牌logo</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td colspan=\"2\" class=\"bold\">模特不能是坐姿（婴儿模特除外）</td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <div class=\"tips-block\">\n    <p class=\"tips-title\">Tips：所需要用到的一些链接</p>\n    <p class=\"link-line\">字符数工具:<a href=\"https://www.amz520.com/amztools/amtitletool.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.amz520.com/amztools/amtitletool.html</a></p>\n    <p class=\"link-line\">listing 文案创作：<a href=\"https://wordkit.cn/copywriting.jsp\" target=\"_blank\">https://wordkit.cn/copywriting.jsp</a></p>\n    <p class=\"link-line\">热搜词：<a href=\"https://www.amz123.com/usatopkeywords\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.amz123.com/usatopkeywords</a></p>\n  </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
